Spec: Formal SDK control recovery verification

Purpose:
  Verify formal capability gating, operation correlation and original policy limits without native-device claims.

Owns:
  ./FormalSessionTest.java

Must:
  Reject unnegotiated or unapproved experimental calls before transport, preserve known Broker errors and mark lost mutation replies unknown without automatic retries.
  Parse typed connection/stream operation results and preserve original nested policy bytes through the control envelope.
